{"id":"85e306b51d3267ec","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-fixed-point.md","title":"Weak Fixed Points and Boolos Fixed Points","display":"df-fixed-point — Weak Fixed Points and Boolos Fixed Points","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-fixed-point","aliases":["89-df-fixed-point"],"display":"df-fixed-point — Weak Fixed Points and Boolos Fixed Points","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","[[89-df-substitution-modal]]","[[89-df-dotted-box]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-fixed-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fixed-point — Weak Fixed Points and Boolos Fixed Points"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71b4f56d6213ff7c\" href=\"?note=71b4f56d6213ff7c\" title=\"89-df-modal-subformula\">89-df-modal-subformula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" href=\"?note=48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" title=\"89-df-substitution-modal\">89-df-substitution-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"95a48b6ae42f7e48\" href=\"?note=95a48b6ae42f7e48\" title=\"89-df-dotted-box\">89-df-dotted-box</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 为固定公式集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fix}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Fix}_L\\)</span> 保留既有弱不动点接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BFix}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{BFix}_L\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BookFix}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{BookFix}_L\\)</span> 是下文引入的加强谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 为出现字母集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+\">\\(\\Box^+\\)</span> 为 dotted box。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Fix}_L(A,p,B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\\land(B\\leftrightarrow A[p:=B])\\in L,\\\\\n\\mathrm{BFix}_L(A,p,B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\\land\n(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\leftrightarrow\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow B))\\in L,\\\\\n\\mathrm{BookFix}_L(A,p,B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BFix}_L(A,p,B)\\land\n\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\setminus\\{p\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Fix}_L(A,p,B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\\land(B\\leftrightarrow A[p:=B])\\in L,\\\\\n\\mathrm{BFix}_L(A,p,B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\\land\n(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\leftrightarrow\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow B))\\in L,\\\\\n\\mathrm{BookFix}_L(A,p,B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BFix}_L(A,p,B)\\land\n\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\setminus\\{p\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 104、116–117；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>原有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fix}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Fix}_L\\)</span> 的真值不变：命题模态语法无绑定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 不出现与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B[p:=C]=B[p:=D]\">\\(B[p:=C]=B[p:=D]\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\">\\(C,D\\)</span> 成立等价（可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\bot,D=\\top\">\\(C=\\bot,D=\\top\\)</span> 并检查唯一树读法）。直接使用已定义的出现字母集，去掉无关的 GL 专用等价依赖。\nBoolos 第 8 章 p.104 的不动点带 dotted-box 等价与“无新增字母”，由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BookFix}\">\\(\\mathrm{BookFix}\\)</span> 精确表示。对 GL 中模态化的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，弱与加强版本在相同 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-自由域上等价；这个事实是后续证明，不能作为定义偷加。一般 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=p\">\\(A=p\\)</span> 的每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-自由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 都是弱不动点，但不存在 Boolos 加强不动点，因此离开模态化条件不能混称。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"71b4f56d6213ff7c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-substitution-modal","status":"resolved","id":"48f7a8aeae4eecb4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-substitution-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-dotted-box","status":"resolved","id":"95a48b6ae42f7e48","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-dotted-box]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fix}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BFix}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BookFix}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Fix}_L(A,p,B)&\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\\land(B\\leftrightarrow A[p:=B])\\in L,\\\\\n\\mathrm{BFix}_L(A,p,B)&\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\\land\n(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\leftrightarrow\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow B))\\in L,\\\\\n\\mathrm{BookFix}_L(A,p,B)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BFix}_L(A,p,B)\\land\n\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\setminus\\{p\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fix}_L","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"B[p:=C]=B[p:=D]","display":false},{"tex":"C,D","display":false},{"tex":"C=\\bot,D=\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BookFix}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"A=p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":2017,"backlinks":[{"id":"02536e2efd437c59","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1cd2a39dee160249","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"636cbfa2301b039f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6d85c656be153752","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"426d9ae12ef39fe8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84538a9442ddea2d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ce272d08b1c31931","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6c6cad39792d5f33","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4ba460c900107e00","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dc27d1abcea524e3","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"判据与唯一性：[[89-df-fixed-point]] → [[89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness]] → [[89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness]]；[[89-lem-modalized-valuation-locality]] → [[89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point]] → [[89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence]]。"}],"outgoing":["71b4f56d6213ff7c","48f7a8aeae4eecb4","95a48b6ae42f7e48"]}